391", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974471_782428476616724_1116172443318779459_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9O0aROjGQu4Q7kNvwGTJTp9&_nc_oc=AdpRAo5ep6OcHWg80tEvFqayR2RaVQp_dhdekX1sCPNcuZ2yPJIgRgg1AOPREDdm1E0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN8wHY1PwRN_JD7wInUHwQkl1tgoC3lUGnMj-ZWtoEGOQ&oe=6AC8F811"}, {"file_name": "scr_4.png", "id": "159298223794289", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_159298230460955_160499850208589564_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nIPJ1hqtf0gQ7kNvwHqg4UH&_nc_oc=AdpB3kVE5nxHYsyLq2e2g-VCczyMXKPRDh5ddrf5D2gZtF4yKJ3_dG40-zrnf4hd2Y0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMoTerURk_r4QCMApzN3XaIJ3aclDxIOdr__oJVAPlZ6w&oe=6AC8FFDD"}, {"file_name": "scr_3.png", "id": "1622890074875818", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_1622890078209151_210179435196440368_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jECtmq4ARyYQ7kNvwERl4ux&_nc_oc=Adr0E1c4os2KS-JxigpaEXocusj5GTSVVYIYYxS2wxIGChxUkfrSGZ83sPRyzZCjd5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMgoGoPLcezQCo1sYtOEC01Fr7UqqNUba7MQAjTXPaJag&oe=6AC8F2B9"}, {"file_name": "scr_2.png", "id": "177703811915843", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_177703815249176_1528287960455225088_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Q4mz-65FuQQ7kNvwF19TeP&_nc_oc=Ado7L2ZuDzXVNW8gksMUSLNtJ3O3f0Z3G5aUvXK_EkfaxTUd8lGEKP8149H17LhlQQ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMRCN9P-2HD6i6_Rw-co-xfbFq3dTlcdHlAgoFKyrTHhA&oe=6AC9194A"}, {"file_name": "scr_5.png", "id": "808935813774196", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031332_808935817107529_8861221418933832083_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4OHpIIOK-mcQ7kNvwHl-J4w&_nc_oc=AdqR0xPwiDKhjA3vgwEuAzfpwqfavIiX8GBmb9XFgWCiP92DtfArr-EyYn2tCI_qgV8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO2Z-1OMius_uf3BDF8c2VCbUJMp-N53OuW8j0tzP4S7A&oe=6AC91A1C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The king is gone", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In this game, you have to run away. Different doors are blocking the way, that need to be unlocked to proceed as fast as possible. Each door will give a different benefit, and a combination of them is the key to succeed .. or fail.\n\nTo open a door, a puzzle is presented, where pieces of a key have to be rotated and merged together to open the door. The further you run, the more difficult the key puzzles become.\n\nThere are three different modes:\n\n* Normal Mode: Score is increasing the more you survive. It decreases the more you stay idle in a room without picking a door. There's a set amount of rooms to complete before reaching the end.\n* Endless Mode: Score increases with each room that is completed. There is no end to the amount of rooms presented.\n* Random Mode: Each door has a specific score as a reward when opened. Rooms and their rewards spawn at random.\n\nThe available benefits from the doors are:\n\n* Green doors: Increase running speed.\n* Purple doors: Increase lock-picking skills, which makes opening new doors easier.\n* Blue doors: Gives extra chances before losing.\n* Brown doors provide no direct benefit, apart from helping complete more rooms.", "short_description": "A puzzle game about running, not because one has somewhere to be, but because one has somewhere they don't want to be."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://afloofdev.com/privacy_policy/games/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Afloofdev", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.afloofdev.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "37